#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiopreviewproperty.rst:14 24663a9a79304f54923974472b57c8ef
msgid "Custom property editor control for previewing FMOD audio streams in the editor."
msgstr "用于在编辑器中预览 FMOD 音频流的自定义属性控件。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiopreviewproperty.rst:19 3a4b986283f249e491d6cbccf179bf17
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiopreviewproperty.rst:21 04d4510c78c645b69c83f0746aa82a2c
msgid ""
"Displays an audio waveform, playback controls, a position indicator, and time labels for "
":ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>` in the inspector. Clicking the waveform seeks "
"playback."
msgstr "在检查器中为  :ref:`FmodAudioStream<class_FmodAudioStream>`  显示波形、播放控件、位置指示器和时间标签。点击波形可跳转播放位置。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiopreviewproperty.rst:23 6ad9eae63afd4836b5a2fb306c56d301
msgid ""
"Shares waveform cache data with the ``stream`` property previews on "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>`, "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D>`, and "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>`. Waveform generation is deferred to"
" a later main-thread call."
msgstr ""
"与 "
":ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>`、:ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer2D>`"
" 和 :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer3D>` 的 ``stream`` "
"属性预览共享波形缓存。波形生成延迟到之后的主线程调用。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudiopreviewproperty.rst:25 1e9a96ef1851462982fbcdb813d1547b
msgid ""
"Inspector audition uses an internal :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>` "
"routed to ``Master``. In independent bus mode, its levels appear in the visible FMOD Audio Dock. "
"The Dock does not display levels from a separate running game process."
msgstr ""
"检查器试听通过内部 :ref:`FmodAudioStreamPlayer<class_FmodAudioStreamPlayer>` 播放，发送到 "
"``Master``。独立总线模式下，可在展开的 FMOD Audio 面板查看其电平；独立运行游戏进程的电平暂未接入。"

